1
00:00:00,125 --> 00:00:02,445
ARTETA: Meet our real striker.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,100
GYÖKERES: Then why am I here?

3
00:00:07,584 --> 00:00:08,984
ARTETA: Win us corners.

4
00:00:09,064 --> 00:00:10,104
ARTETA: That's where we score.

5
00:00:11,292 --> 00:00:12,342
ARTETA: Don't shoot!

6
00:00:12,392 --> 00:00:13,252
ARTETA: Hit the defender.

7
00:00:13,252 --> 00:00:15,212
ARTETA: Off him, out for a corner!

8
00:00:19,167 --> 00:00:20,717
ARTETA: Perfect. A corner!

9
00:00:20,807 --> 00:00:22,047
ARTETA: Now we can actually score.
